source":["**Post Type:** All types (Image, Reel, Text, Video) perform almost equally. Reel and Video have slightly higher engagement rate, but no big difference.\n","\n","**Best Category** : Education is the top category with highest average likes (∼10.4k). Fitness is slightly lower. Overall all 8 categories are within a close range.Country: No country has a major lead. US, UK, Canada show slightly higher average engagement rate, but difference is very small.2.\n","\n","**User TrendsAge**: Age has no effect on engagement. An 18-year-old and a 50-year-old get similar likes. No correlation found.Verified Accounts: Verified accounts get about 10% more likes than non-verified accounts. Verification helps a little, but does not guarantee high likes."],"metadata":{"id":"3dKSuv1nRzRY"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":[],"metadata":{"id":"c-MMWfe1TVnm"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":[],"metadata":{"id":"Xzx7ktNiR007"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# Behavioral Insights"],"metadata":{"id":"WKItKp8TSMG1"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["**Best Time for Impressions**: Evening time from 6 PM to 9 PM gets the highest impressions. People view posts more at night.\n","\n","**Device Impact** : Mobile devices have the highest watch time, followed by Tablet and Desktop. Users spend more time watching on mobile."],"metadata":{"id":"4UbIHE0hSsoN"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["**Sentiment Analysis**\n","\n","**Best Sentiment**: Positive sentiment posts perform best with highest likes and engagement rate.\n","\n","**Negative/Neutral**: Negative sentiment posts perform the worst. Neutral is in the middle. People engage less with negative content."],"metadata":{"id":"C3CNhhuOTjC1"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":[],"metadata":{"id":"c7NkvJ7U5ZEF","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1793168994753,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":44,"user":{"displayName":"Sreeja Ramachandran","userId":"03163988967332367722"}}},"execution_count":62,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","sourc